        "original_id": "268258ba-4f67-5b91-8e08-8074287483f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bear Lane, Christ Church, Oxford, Bear Inn, Oxford, Alfred Street, Blue Boar Street, Oxford, England\n- Organizations: University of Oxford, Corpus Christi College\n- People: Heinz Cassirer, Paton\n\nFacts:\n- Christ Church, Oxford is a constituent college of the University of Oxford in England.\n- Bear Lane is located just north of Christ Church, Oxford.\n- The circa-17th-century incarnation of the Bear Inn, Oxford stands on the corner of Alfred Street and Blue Boar Street in central Oxford, opposite Bear Lane and just north of Christ Church.\n- Following Paton, Heinz Cassirer moved to Oxford and lectured at Corpus Christi College.",
